// ---- Floor fog -------------------------------------------------------------
//
// FOG WITH A TOP. ddz_fog is sector fog: a distance tint on surfaces, uniform
// floor to ceiling, simulating nothing in the air. It cannot have a ceiling, a
// thickness you stand in, or a bright patch where a torch sweeps it -- you
// cannot be knee deep in it, because it has no knees.
//
// This is a horizontal slab of mist with a world-space top, solved
// analytically in the fragment shader: how much of the eye-to-pixel ray lay
// below the ceiling, fogged by that length. No raymarch.
server bool  gitd_fog_enabled = false;

