// ---- Laser grid ------------------------------------------------------------
//
// REAL beams standing across a corridor, not a pattern painted on the walls.
//
// The sweep band fill draws a lattice on every SURFACE the band crosses --
// continuous around corners and up walls, which beams cannot do because a beam
// is straight. This is the other half: each line is an actual segment of light
// hanging in the air between those surfaces, which a fill cannot do because a
// fill has no volume. Run both and the grid is drawn on the room AND in it.
//
